title: Kurdish Issue
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
view-if: CHP_in_government == 1

= Kurdish Issue

# Localization

- @associations: Remove administrative and legal obstacles to the rights of Kurdish citizens to form and organize for Kurdish associations.
- @public_discussion: Lift restrictions on discussing the Kurdish Issue in the public sphere.
- @publishing: Grant legal permission for Kurdish printing and publishing activities under regulation.
- @meetings: Ease restrictions on the right to hold meetings and demonstrations.
- @oversight: Strengthen protection and oversight mechanisms against acts of unlawful violence by public officials and security forces.
- @local_government: Expand the financial and administrative powers of local governments by reorganizing the distribution of duties and authority between the governor's office and the municipal administration.
- @root: Back to main.

